      "content": "{\"task_id\": \"v2-incident-08-07\", \"workflow\": \"incident\", \"ticket_id\": \"T-v2-incident-08-07-0\", \"service_id\": \"S-v2-incident-08-07-0\", \"goals\": [\"incident\", \"notify\"], \"structure\": \"branch_multi\", \"instructions\": \"Read the requested service. If healthy, read its policy and only notify for it. Otherwise read all its dependency_service_ids and each dependency's policy, then record an incident and notification for each dependency in service_id order. Do not write to the requested service in this branch.\", \"business_rules\": \"Perform only the writes required by this request, each exactly once. Read required data from tools; retry missing or incomplete reads. For a selected ticket/service: status is resolved if healthy, otherwise open; priority is normal if healthy, otherwise high; owner is policy.owner; note is diagnosis:{service_id}:{state}:{policy.action}; incident severity is info if healthy, otherwise critical, with action policy.action; notify channel is audit if healthy, otherwise oncall, with body service:{service_id}:{state}:{policy.action}. Severity order is outage > degraded > healthy. Do not write to unselected objects.\"}"
